# PROJECT: FINDORA — CANVAS PROTOCOL EDITION

## Interactive Drag-and-Drop Lost & Found Platform

### 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, creative UI/UX designer, interaction designer, and hackathon solution architect.

Transform my EXISTING Digital Lost & Found application into a highly interactive, production-oriented canvas interface that complies with the new Code Variant hackathon challenge: THE CANVAS PROTOCOL.

IMPORTANT:

* Do not start a new project from scratch.
* Inspect the existing source code and preserve its architecture wherever practical.
* Preserve all existing authentication, database integrations, routes, user profiles, item reports, maps, and other working functionality.
* Implement the new interaction model throughout the application.
* Do not create a static prototype or a frontend-only demonstration.
* Connect every primary drag-and-drop action to the application's actual business logic and persistent storage.

The final application must be visually impressive, intuitive, responsive, and genuinely functional.

